---
import StudioLayout from '../../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import { studioPeopleNotes } from '../../../lib/studioHelp';
---

<StudioLayout
  title="Students help"
  description="Private guide to Studio Students and People."
  heading="Students help"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 py-5 md:py-8">
    <p class="text-sm">
      <a href="/studio/help" class="text-gel underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold hover:underline">
        ← All help
      </a>
      {' · '}
      <a href="/studio/students" class="text-gel underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold hover:underline">
        Open Students
      </a>
    </p>

    <section class="mt-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-spotlight">{studioPeopleNotes.title}</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">{studioPeopleNotes.summary}</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-muted">
        <li>
          Open{' '}
          <a href="/studio/students" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Students</a>
          {' '}then{' '}
          <a href={studioPeopleNotes.path} class="text-gel hover:text-gold">{studioPeopleNotes.title}</a>
          {' '}when your account has People permission.
        </li>
        <li>Tap <span class="text-spotlight">Add person</span>, enter a name, and choose one or more personas.</li>
        <li>
          Open a person to add student or agent fields, notes, related links (student ↔ parent),
          and student lifetime value. Archive hides them from the main list without deleting history.
        </li>
        <li>
          The list shows 10 people per page, sorted by last name then first. Search and persona
          filters apply across every page.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">
        On a person with an email, use <strong>Send a message</strong> for pay links, a Confirmed
        resend, a manual reminder, or casting thanks. Each send is an explicit tap — not voice.
        Students can opt in to SMS reminders on their People record.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-spotlight">Schedules and status mail</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">
        Under{' '}
        <a href="/studio/calendar" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Schedules</a>, new requests stay{' '}
        <strong>Requested</strong> until Elyse accepts the Google invite (or taps Confirm if Google is
        down). Students get transactional email at Requested and again at Confirmed. Confirmed lessons
        receive an automatic email reminder the day before.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-spotlight">Lifetime value and pay status</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">
        Stripe checkout emails are matched to a student (or a parent’s linked student). The person
        page shows Stripe plus offline Venmo/cash/Zelle as lifetime value. Refunds lower the Stripe
        rollup. Charges that do not match stay under{' '}
        <a href="/studio/students/payments" class="text-gel hover:text-gold">Payment status</a>
        {' '}as “needs a person.” Copy or share the 30- and 60-minute Payment Links from that page
        or a student record. Studio never charges a card from voice.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-spotlight">Residual</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">
        Upcoming-lesson paid/unpaid on Payment status still waits on joining confirmed lessons.
        Studio-wide holidays will live under Admin → Calendar later, not under Students.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</StudioLayout>
